, "value": "<strong>Unfold the Fun of 30 Years of Pok\u00e9mon!</strong>\r\n<br>Get in on the excitement of 30 years of Pok\u00e9mon with a poster featuring images of over 160 cards from the special <em>30th Celebration</em> expansion! You also get foil promo cards featuring three powerful Legendary Pok\u00e9mon from the Kanto region\u2014Articuno, Zapdos, and Moltres\u2014plus a handful of booster packs with even more Pok\u00e9mon inside.\r\n<br><br>Each sealed case contains 6 collections. The Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration Poster Collection contains:\r\n<br>\u2022 3 foil promo card featuring Articuno, Zapdos, and Moltres\r\n<br>\u2022 1 double-sided poster 26.875\" x 39\"\r\n<br>\u2022\u00a03 Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration booster packs <em>(cards vary by pack)</em>"}, {"name": "UPC", "displayName": "UPC", "value": "10196214158754"}]}, {"productId": 709034, "name": "30th Celebration Tech Sticker Collection Case", "cleanName": "30th Celebration Tech Sticker Collection Case", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/709034_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 3, "groupId": 24722, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/709034/pokemon-me-30th-celebration-30th-celebration-tech-sticker-collection-case", "modifiedOn": "2026-09-16T04:10:15.28", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": "2026-09-16T00:00:00", "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "CardText", "displayName": "Card Text", "value": "Commemorate 30 years of joy with fan-favorite Pok\u00e9mon spanning three dazzling decades! Celebrate this magnificent milestone with the mighty presences of Mewtwo ex and Mew ex, followed by a wealth of allies like Umbreon ex, Salamence ex, and Greninja ex. Plus, there are 30 reasons to honor Pikachu, as each booster pack contains one\u2014with 30 unique variations to collet as Pikachu rare cards! And, whether you're looking forward to a glittering future or taking a nostalgic look at a storied past, there are a host of treasures to find and secrets to reveal in the Pok\u00e9mon TCG: 30th Celebration!\r\n<br><br>Each sealed case contains 12 collections, six of each design. The Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration Tech Sticker Collection contains:\r\n<br>\u2022 1 foil promo card featuring Alolan Exeggutor or Lucario\r\n<br>\u2022 1 tech sticker sheet\r\n<br>\u2022\u00a03 Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration booster packs <em>(cards vary by pack)</em>"}, {"name": "UPC", "displayName": "UPC", "value": "10196214158778"}]}, {"productId": 709035, "name": "30th Celebration Knock Out Collection Case", "cleanName": "30th Celebration Knock Out Collection Case", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/709035_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 3, "groupId": 24722, "url": "https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/709035/pokemon-me-30th-celebration-30th-celebration-knock-out-collection-case", "modifiedOn": "2026-09-16T04:10:15.28", "imageCount": 1, "presaleInfo": {"isPresale": false, "releasedOn": "2026-09-16T00:00:00", "note": null}, "extendedData": [{"name": "CardText", "displayName": "Card Text", "value": "<strong>Thirty years of Pok\u00e9mon, One Awesome Set!</strong>\r\n<br>Celebrate 30 years of Pok\u00e9mon and discover a treasure trove of Pok\u00e9mon TCG fun in this special set featuring the Evolution Pok\u00e9mon Eevee as a cool foil card! You'll also find two Pok\u00e9mon TCG booster packs to open, plus a plastic coin.\r\n<br><br>Each sealed case contains 24 Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration Knock Out Collections. The Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration Knock Out Collection contains:\r\n<br>\u2022 1 foil promo card featuring Eevee\r\n<br>\u2022 1 plastic coin\r\n<br>\u2022\u00a02 Pokemon TCG: 30th Celebration booster packs <em>(cards vary by pack)</em>"}, {"name": "UPC", "displayName": "UPC", "value": "10196214152394"}]}, {"productId": 709036, "name": "30th Celebration Elite Trainer Box Case", "cleanName": "30th Celebration Elite Trainer Box Case", "imageUrl": "https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/709036_200w.jpg", "categoryId": 